<title>USA: Marsh &amp; McLennan down after secondary.</title>
<headline>Marsh &amp; McLennan down after secondary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc fell about two percent in heavy trading on Tuesday after the company completed a secondary stock offering.</p>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan on Monday said its secondary offering of 3.09 million shares of common stock by former stockholders and retirees of Johnson &amp; Higgins had been priced at $119 per share.</p>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan fell 2-1/2, or about two percent, on Tuesday to 120-1/8.</p>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan completed the acquisition of Johnson &amp; Higgins on March 27.</p>
